All files in this repository (source code, graphics, avatar generation rules,
sounds, text, layout, etc.) are the copyrighted work of Chae Lab.

This repository is public solely for GitHub Pages hosting. Public visibility
does NOT grant any open-source license.

Permitted
  · Playing the game via the official web address
    (https://environe21-code.github.io/Moaten/) or the official Google Play app
    (io.github.environe21_code.twa)
  · Capturing screenshots for personal sharing, reviews, or coverage

Prohibited
  · Copying, modifying, translating, re-hosting, or redistributing any part
    of these files
  · Republishing the game on any app store or website under any name
  · Using the names "MoaTEN" / "모아텐", the app icon, or the logo
  · Writing to the ranking server (Firebase) from anything other than the
    official app
  · Any commercial use

Violations will be addressed through Google Play copyright (DMCA) takedown
and applicable law.
Contact: chaejs21@gmail.com
